title: "quantum-rag"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Salvatore Pennacchio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tatopenn-cell/quantum-rag"
abstract: >
  A small, local, hybrid RAG (retrieval-augmented generation) tool
  combining TF-IDF, dense bi-encoder retrieval, cross-encoder
  reranking, and exact-match search over local PDF/Markdown corpora.
